 are having to move from  theaters to online venues and Mubi calm  is one of these venues Mubi is an  excellent resource that's helping to  sustain arts cinema online they have a  hand curated library of 30 films at a  time that's made up of international  films independent films films from  festivals hard-to-find gems and classics  you can stream them or download them  it's a great way not just to watch  movies but to discover something new to  watch and you can get it for 30 days for  free when you go to MU be calm / Thomas  flight  that's mu be calm / Thomas flight it's  available all around the world and if  you're interested in exploring cinema in  a deeper way I recommend you give Moby a  try thank you so much for watching  special thank you to my patreon  supporters you can go to  patreon.com/scishow  [Music]

